  "title": "System-description review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>System-description review</h2><p>Classify commitments and evaluate a description omission.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f1\">Category for A</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"Processing integrity\">Processing integrity</option><option value=\"Only availability\">Only availability</option><option value=\"Only confidentiality\">Only confidentiality</option><option value=\"Only privacy\">Only privacy</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f2\">Category for B</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Availability\">Availability</option><option value=\"Only privacy\">Only privacy</option><option value=\"Only tax reporting\">Only tax reporting</option><option value=\"Only valuation\">Only valuation</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f3\">Category most directly associated with D</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f3\"><option value=\"Privacy\">Privacy</option><option value=\"Only inventory existence\">Only inventory existence</option><option value=\"Only valuation\">Only valuation</option><option value=\"Only debt classification\">Only debt classification</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f4\">Response to the missing rejection process</label><select id=\"isc-m3-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Evaluate and correct the description and related controls\">Evaluate and correct the description and related controls</option><option value=\"Ignore all omitted processes\">Ignore all omitted processes</option><option value=\"Assume rejected transactions do not matter\">Assume rejected transactions do not matter</option><option value=\"Delete the completeness commitment\">Delete the completeness commitment</option></select></div></section>",
